{"text":"kuruntokai","n":122,"lines":["பைங்காற் கொக்கின் புன்புறத் தன்ன","குண்டுநீர் ஆம்பலும் கூம்பின இனியே","வந்தன்று வாழியோ மாலை","ஒருதான் அன்றே கங்குலும் உடைத்தே"],"tr":["paiṅkāṟ kokkiṉ puṉpuṟat taṉṉa","kuṇṭunīr āmpalum kūmpiṉa iṉiyē","vantaṉṟu vāḻiyō mālai","orutāṉ aṉṟē kaṅkulum uṭaittē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"neytal","tinai_ta":"நெய்தல்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஓரம் போகியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Ōram Pōkiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 14, veṇcīr 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 6"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"பைங்காற்","tr":"paiṅkāṟ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பைங்","tr":"paiṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"காற்","tr":"kāṟ"}]},{"text":"கொக்கின்","tr":"kokkiṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொக்","tr":"kok"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கின்","tr":"kiṉ"}]},{"text":"புன்புறத்","tr":"puṉpuṟat","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"புன்","tr":"puṉ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"புறத்","tr":"puṟat"}]},{"text":"தன்ன","tr":"taṉṉa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ன","tr":"ṉa"}]}],[{"text":"குண்டுநீர்","tr":"kuṇṭunīr","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குண்","tr":"kuṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுநீர்","tr":"ṭunīr"}]},{"text":"ஆம்பலும்","tr":"āmpalum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஆம்","tr":"ām"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பலும்","tr":"palum"}]},{"text":"கூம்பின","tr":"kūmpiṉa","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூம்","tr":"kūm"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"பின","tr":"piṉa"}]},{"text":"இனியே","tr":"iṉiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இனி","tr":"iṉi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}],[{"text":"வந்தன்று","tr":"vantaṉṟu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வந்","tr":"van"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தன்","tr":"taṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"வாழியோ","tr":"vāḻiyō","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ழியோ","tr":"ḻiyō"}]},{"text":"மாலை","tr":"mālai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]}],[{"text":"ஒருதான்","tr":"orutāṉ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ஒரு","tr":"oru"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தான்","tr":"tāṉ"}]},{"text":"அன்றே","tr":"aṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அன்","tr":"aṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"கங்குலும்","tr":"kaṅkulum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கங்","tr":"kaṅ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குலும்","tr":"kulum"}]},{"text":"உடைத்தே","tr":"uṭaittē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உடைத்","tr":"uṭait"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"பைங்கால்","parts":[{"text":"பைங்கால்","lemma":"பைங்கால்","gloss":"green-legged"}],"gloss":"green-legged","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொக்கின்","parts":[{"text":"கொக்கு","lemma":"கொக்கு","gloss":"heron"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of"}],"gloss":"of the heron"},{"surface":"புன்புறத்து","parts":[{"text":"புன்","lemma":"புல்","gloss":"dull"},{"text":"புறத்து","lemma":"புறம்","gloss":"back"}],"gloss":"dull back"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"குண்டுநீர்","parts":[{"text":"குண்டு","lemma":"குண்டு","gloss":"deep"},{"text":"நீர்","lemma":"நீர்","gloss":"water"}],"gloss":"deep water"},{"surface":"ஆம்பலும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆம்பல்","lemma":"ஆம்பல்","gloss":"water-lily"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"water-lily also"},{"surface":"கூம்பின","parts":[{"text":"கூம்பு","lemma":"கூம்பு","gloss":"to close"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"past tense marker"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"neuter plural suffix"}],"gloss":"have closed"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"இனி","gloss":"now"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"now indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வந்தன்று","parts":[{"text":"வந்தன்று","lemma":"வந்தன்று","gloss":"has arrived"}],"gloss":"has arrived","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"வாழியோ","parts":[{"text":"வாழி","lemma":"வாழி","gloss":"may you live"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"address particle"}],"gloss":"may you live"},{"surface":"மாலை","parts":[{"text":"மாலை","lemma":"மாலை","gloss":"evening"}],"gloss":"evening"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருதான்","parts":[{"text":"ஒரு","lemma":"ஒரு","gloss":"one"},{"text":"தான்","lemma":"தான்","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"alone"},{"surface":"அன்றே","parts":[{"text":"அன்று","lemma":"அன்று","gloss":"not so"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is it not"},{"surface":"கங்குலும்","parts":[{"text":"கங்குல்","lemma":"கங்குல்","gloss":"night"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"night also"},{"surface":"உடைத்தே","parts":[{"text":"உடைத்து","lemma":"உடைத்து","gloss":"possessing"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"it possesses"}]}],"literal":"Like the pale back of the green-legged heron, / the water-lilies in the deep water have also closed now. / Evening has arrived, may you live! / Not only that, it also possesses the night.","translation":"Like the pale back of the green-legged heron, the water-lilies in the deep water have folded their petals now. Evening has arrived—may you live! And it is not alone, for it brings the night along with it.","modern":"பச்சை நிறக் கால்களைக் கொண்ட நாரையின் வெளுத்த முதுகைப் போல, ஆழமான நீரில் உள்ள ஆம்பல் மலர்களும் இப்போது கூம்பிவிட்டன. மாலைப் பொழுது வந்துவிட்டது, நீ வாழ்க! அதுமட்டும் அல்ல, அது தன்னோடு காரிருள் நிறைந்த இரவையும் கூட்டிக் கொண்டு வந்துள்ளது.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her confidante in deep distress as the day ends. She observes that the water-lilies in the deep pools have closed, looking just like the pale backs of green-legged herons. This visual change signals that evening, the most painful time for separated lovers, has arrived. She addresses the evening with bitter irony, wishing it well, and notes that it does not come alone. It brings with it the dark, lonely night, which will only intensify her grief of separation.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.9],[0.9,1.5],[1.62,2.03],[2.03,2.7],[2.7,2.9],[2.9,3.4],[3.4,3.7],[3.7,4.7],[4.7,5.2],[5.2,5.5],[5.5,6.5],[6.5,6.8],[6.8,7.1],[7.1,7.4]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.85],[0.85,1.4],[1.4,1.8],[1.8,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,5.6],[5.6,6.1],[6.1,6.5],[6.5,7.6],[7.6,8.0],[8.0,8.3],[8.3,8.7]]},"sync":[[["பைங்கால்","green-legged"]],[["கொக்கின்","of the heron"]],[["புன்புறத்து","dull back"]],[["புன்புறத்து","dull back"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["குண்டுநீர்","deep water"]],[["ஆம்பலும்","water-lily also"]],[["கூம்பின","have closed"]],[["இனியே","now indeed"]],[["வந்தன்று","has arrived"]],[["வாழியோ","may you live"]],[["மாலை","evening"]],[["ஒருதான்","alone"]],[["அன்றே","is it not"]],[["கங்குலும்","night also"]],[["உடைத்தே","it possesses"]]]}